Striped Bird was added in '''Beta 30.0''' as a 5G 4/3 monster with the somewhat odd Turbo effect which gives it Charge if you have 2 or more Disarmed monsters in your hand. '''Beta 31.0''', like many other DR cards, changed it. In this case, it gained +1 HP. '''Beta 43.1''' followed this with -1 cost, ending up with 4/4/4.
[[File:Striped Bird (Beta 43.1).png|thumb|254x254px|Beta 43.1]]
'''Beta 49.0''' reworked it. Gaining -1/+1 to end up at 3/5, it now has Haste and will Paralyze itself after attacking. '''Beta 50.0''' gave it +1 ATK, returning it to 4.
[[File:Striped Bird (Beta 49.0).png|thumb|257x257px|Beta 49.0]]

